{{!--
  The export call to action every table page carries.

  Invoke as: {{> components/export-button export}}
  The partial's root context is the page's `export` view. Without JavaScript
  the link downloads the default columns of the first dataset as CSV over the
  page's own window; with it, `services/export.js` opens the dialog rendered
  by `components/export-dialog` instead.
--}}
<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--sm sp-btn--outline" href="{{href}}" data-export-open>Export</a>
